<title>USA: Lawter completes Hach stock sale.</title>
<headline>Lawter completes Hach stock sale.</headline>
<dateline>NORTHBROOK, Ill. 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lawter International Inc said Tuesday it completed the sale of the 27.8 percent stake it held in Hach Co to Hach.</p>
<p>The 3,157,223 shares were sold to Hach for $19 a share, or a total price of $59.99 million.</p>
<p>Lawter shares were off 1/8 at 12-1/4, and Hach was off 1-1/2 at 19.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
